		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Weapon Kit</strong> &middot; <em>Engineer invention. Counts as a weapon for swapping and stowing. Toolbelt options cost 2 Actions and 1 Toolbelt scrap.</em></p><hr><p><strong>Tranq Dart (basic) &mdash; 1 Action.</strong> Range 8, 1d4 Piercing. On hit: 1d4 Acid damage.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt (2 Actions, 1 scrap):</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Glob Shot.</strong> Range 8. Target is Slowed, 1 minute. It bounces to the next nearest target in Range 8. If it's an enemy they are also Slowed; if it's an ally they gain +2 speed once, 1 minute.</li><li><strong>Fumigate.</strong> Cone 3, 3d4 Acid. Allies take no damage and you heal 1 negative condition from allies in the area (not including Wounds).</li><li><strong>Super Elixir.</strong> Range 8, Blast 3, Restore INT HP. Each ally regains the same amount at the start of their next turn.</li></ul><p><strong>High Levels:</strong> +6 Acid damage every 5 levels (Tranq Dart and Fumigate); +2 bonus every 5 levels (Super Elixir).</p>",
